            "slot": "s643",
            "repere": "Paragraphe · I bought this mattress because i wante…",
            "text": "I bought this mattress because i wanted to sleep on a latex firmer option. I usually start on my back and then end up on my side, changing positions many times. I like the mattress when I am on my back, however it is a bit too firm on my side. So I added a mattress topper I had which was foam and it sinks in when pressed. Now I am happpy because it reminds me of the mattress i had many years ago which had a 2\" pillow top.",
            "image": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
        {
