            "slot": "s648",
            "repere": "Paragraphe · Thank you for sharing your experience!…",
            "text": "Thank you for sharing your experience! We're glad to hear that you're enjoying the mattress and found a solution that works well for you. Adding a topper can be a great way to customize the feel of your mattress, especially when you sleep in different positions. We appreciate you choosing us and hope you continue to sleep comfortably!",
